###Create product    
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "title":"my product",
    "description":"my product description",
    "price": 100
}

###Update product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title":"updated ",
    "description":"updated",
    "price": 150
}

###Delete product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

###Get all products user 
